        skos:definition    "Document used by the rail organization to indicate freight charges or additional charges in each case where the departure station is not able to calculate the charges for the total voyage (e.g. tariff not yet updated, part of voyage not covered by the tariff). This document must be considered as joined to the transport."@en;
        skos:notation      "789";
        skos:prefLabel     "Charges note"@en;
        skos:topConceptOf  <https://w3id.org/eudpp/thesauri/document> .

